kubui (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Downloads kubectl, helm, and minikube with SHA256 verification during
    post-installation. Set KUBUI_SKIP_TOOL_DOWNLOAD=1 to skip downloads on
    offline or proxied systems.
  * Declares podman, GTK3, WebKit2, and GI as system dependencies.
  * postinst and postrm only manage /usr/bin symlinks that kubui itself
    created (verified by symlink target), never user-managed binaries.

 -- Dylan <dlnmtchll@gmail.com>  Fri, 04 Jul 2025 12:00:00 +0000
